<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Thermo BioAnalysis started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Thermo BioAnalysis started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- The Gargiulo Group, a division of Oscar Gruss &amp; Son Inc, said it initiated coverage of Thermo BioAnalysis Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Said company is positioned to take advantage of increasing demand for more sophisticated bioinstrumentation.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/2 at 12-1/4.</p>
